        "TileImage": "$($repository 5cf179c7-79b3-4782-8d3a-b0dfe3ca277f).Image",
        "Description": "You have been hired by a 3rd party to deal a blow to the world of Kronstat. For too long have they thought themselves untouchable. 47, you must first let them expend all their recources on this race only to have it called off due to the fates of the Kawoon pit team, whom Kronstat has paid our client to kill. Then deal the blow to Kronstat and steal the helicopler above the Kronstat building. If we can reach there, we can reach anywhere.",
